# Polylang PHP

New files use `WP_Syntex\Polylang\…`. When editing a legacy `PLL_*` class, match that class. Text domain: `polylang`.

```php
namespace WP_Syntex\Polylang\Switcher\Settings;
```

Layout and Rector: `.cursor/reference/php-conventions.md`.
